# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# Copied from the <raw> element of the test case "Write Extended Registers Request Split File Record" in fixtures/modbus/upstream/tcp/ParserSerializerTestsuite.xml (Apache PLC4X v1.0.0, commit ea229918); a test re-derives it from that file.
# Transaction 10, protocol id 0, length 21 (unit id plus 20 PDU bytes), unit id 1 (0x01). Function 0x15 (21) request: byte count 18, two sub-requests. Outside the alpha set, so the PDU layer refuses it.
00 0A 00 00 00 15 01 15 12 06 00 01 27 0F 00 01 00 00 06 00 02 00 00 00 01 00 00
